                  <nc xml:id="m-99cc4c3b-34a6-42e6-814b-c9fada322d0e" pname="a" oct="3" tilt="se" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-1722e794-a9dc-4e36-a1ae-e904a324b7e6" facs="#m-3bebf8dd-23e9-47bc-b3ba-9e94e38acd93" form="minima" /><custos xml:id="m-80ade905-301c-41ae-9e78-14500574fb1c" facs="#m-b3e61362-6787-4155-9d33-e548a090eaca" pname="c" oct="4" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-2bb063a7-bd45-4490-8ca1-387fcb14c29f"><lg xml:id="m-d52f199a-8f3d-43a2-9916-8892a41b0ba1"><l xml:id="m-d15f5272-6ae3-44ba-849b-8351ccf85e1c" facs="#m-1f8f9c87-be49-4137-9781-8f937a151552" label="ambiguous">1654</l><l xml:id="m-c8da4a00-de3c-424b-b39d-5dc7557b0809" facs="#m-4cd7f73d-dc56-4d39-a02a-6c99f784df36" label="ambiguous">September 29.</l><l xml:id="m-9b18d9f2-e5c7-4000-bf5c-440ba822e8f5" facs="#m-4001971a-96e4-498c-a117-d35d074593af" label="lyrics-like">é-ius. Gló-ri-a Pátri. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-6a6edc1f-6849-4620-b7b2-1511874c635e" facs="#m-6bdf4470-5f99-4553-9867-bc0de5543ff9" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-3d99ba28-066c-49a2-b314-968a528ea796" facs="#m-7f086fe0-dac4-4bec-ab6a-1eafaed27f8b" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui miro órdine Angelórum bus tibi ministrántibus in caelo sem¬</l><l xml:id="m-67314349-f1fd-4a81-82e7-d60cecaa65c8" facs="#m-50868a9b-2aa5-454c-95ef-461fa149649b" label="lyrics-like">Oministéria hominúmque dispén- per assístitur,ab his in terra vita</l><l xml:id="m-8031e905-d216-40b9-8c16-53021dde181a" facs="#m-205f3f01-9371-4142-9a8e-ed30dcbfffdc" label="lyrics-like">sas:t concéde propitius; ut a qui- nostra muniátur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-3a15d066-19cc-4a67-91b6-8e09d4e63bbf" facs="#m-fd25b444-17bb-441d-8f6d-56ba4302c91b" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Apocalypsis beati Joannis Apostoli. Apoc. T.</l><l xml:id="m-0c7cb210-243b-4e88-b6df-13d6a26155af" facs="#m-250684f0-8ff8-4e6c-ac4a-2324bf6a3668" label="lyrics-like">N diébus illis: Significávit Deus septem ecclésiis quae sunt in Asia.</l><l xml:id="m-4bc0d8c3-a956-4410-8897-9d8ba0aa2bb9" facs="#m-ea9939f6-2dd4-43d1-a32c-7ff9472e350e" label="lyrics-like">A quae opórtet fieri cito, mittens</l><l xml:id="m-8905360b-83b5-4843-a4f0-da4427cb68d8" facs="#m-50f578f0-c29c-4f4a-a6b8-8388b1c07f97" label="lyrics-like">Grátia vobis, et pax ab eo qui est,</l><l xml:id="m-52670ff4-08bb-49cf-b2c2-aab426cced9c" facs="#m-324a4506-a6c2-4dc4-8a47-35d755c4ca52" label="lyrics-like">et qui erat, et qui ventúrus est: et</l><l xml:id="m-8d3ad384-9b92-4e57-977a-3cf5f249b51f" facs="#m-6ea6d9ea-2b41-478b-9778-199a720ffc16" label="lyrics-like">per Angelum suum servo suo Joán¬</l><l xml:id="m-f3b065b2-14cc-4546-9510-1f2a9f296e2b" facs="#m-d0fd9eab-fa55-4b6c-83ac-103311c74454" label="lyrics-like">a septem spiritibus, qui in conspéctu</l><l xml:id="m-8e15acd6-c854-4c3d-a126-ec64853d1ea7" facs="#m-dde5267f-c6d2-4aa7-9db0-4b7c734f16d0" label="lyrics-like">ni, qui testimónium perhíbuit verbo</l><l xml:id="m-7bf228a0-838d-465f-a68e-7a329a4d402a" facs="#m-18fb9430-56af-4565-93d3-b9cca2f84b26" label="lyrics-like">Dei, et testimónium Jesu Christi,</l><l xml:id="m-d16e7336-ac47-4736-96f9-33c0125b92d7" facs="#m-8ce5884a-bb6a-47d5-8591-1ac9ea275b0c" label="ambiguous">throni ejus sunt : et a Jesu Christo,</l><l xml:id="m-45246125-c254-4b69-9587-188dfa9b97c8" facs="#m-12d3fd8f-c4a3-49f1-a1f6-5afe822d7dab" label="lyrics-like">qui est testis fidélis, primogénitus</l><l xml:id="m-22be56ac-c1b8-49b2-9c63-a9200a2cd722" facs="#m-cf392e82-5316-4120-ad21-f3456666ebdf" label="lyrics-like">quaecúmque vidit. Beãtus qui legit</l><l xml:id="m-0d2a14ff-41fd-485a-9904-3f2561e921cd" facs="#m-34091f0f-b69d-42b4-874d-a13a46c636a7" label="lyrics-like">mortuórum, et princeps regum ter¬</l><l xml:id="m-9abe9dce-27dc-42c6-8ba3-0e6b7b7a6a44" facs="#m-867907b7-3501-4c1c-9ca4-8f65a551fea0" label="ambiguous">et audit verba prophetiae hujus: et</l><l xml:id="m-ce3cf762-d1f7-407d-a63e-573dad83da98" facs="#m-084d0b8d-5e90-4406-aa5c-5dff58ece622" label="ambiguous">servat ea quae in ea scripta sunt:</l><l xml:id="m-0e522f6f-bb42-47c8-8e0b-489ca1b62243" facs="#m-15faabe2-15e3-409c-906c-64d1603027bc" label="lyrics-like">rae, qui diléxit nos et lavit nosa</l><l xml:id="m-fe34d689-78e7-485a-adaa-b2e199538ee6" facs="#m-59d6aa3d-cd12-4515-af2a-6c2c66b84ef9" label="lyrics-like">tempus enim prope est. Joánnes! peccátis nostris in sánguine suo.</l><l xml:id="m-50d512b9-9354-449f-bbec-c1d5026f46f1" facs="#m-546928da-cf5a-4657-8fdb-4cfb50ab5a0e" label="ambiguous">Grad.E</l><l xml:id="m-a9b1fd84-b9d9-4a3b-8904-8a7a70df3ed5" facs="#m-63834663-0da6-4d32-bf4a-8dba5e309d66" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-2fdd77e8-9665-430d-8f19-12547d3ba676" facs="#m-e9fa112d-5360-4f36-ae42-d74fd57b649e" label="lyrics-like">B Ene- dí¬ ci-te</l><l xml:id="m-4605c23a-2fb4-4c92-9611-170208c2dcec" facs="#m-bc1d1072-df0a-4e98-abd0-3c5a3c9941dd" label="lyrics-like">"Dó- mi-num</l><l xml:id="m-aaa43496-cfda-49fd-90c5-00a086456401" facs="#m-b93da0f9-be74-4e75-8849-52066908d3b3" label="lyrics-like">ómnes Ange-li é¬</l><l xml:id="m-bb6059a6-fbe9-4d7d-a4fe-c3573ef1090d" facs="#m-e17d509d-b3bd-4673-8f0e-38015521d266" label="ambiguous">jus:</l><l xml:id="m-c079647b-6461-464a-8a85-bad52bd09646" facs="#m-7d4a61c0-a751-4ec8-81c9-e3cb056731b2" label="lyrics-like">qui fá¬ ci¬</l><l xml:id="m-59339097-ec08-42de-9f64-3d8c92c9b90f" facs="#m-0d3ab720-57e0-447f-a9d8-04d739acf97f" label="lyrics-like">potén-tes vir-tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-764093ee-b214-49fc-a1b7-c00a466430e6" facs="#m-f262cab6-9d5c-4adc-91ea-ea2085887ed4" label="ambiguous">te,</l><l xml:id="m-29d7dbe7-af51-4d6e-9f64-788e880c615a" facs="#m-49e8e86e-c31c-4907-aa7c-6b842eb5e0e6" label="lyrics-like">tis vérbum é-jus.</l><l xml:id="m-d9a91503-6920-408a-ae07-3d933fe54a29" facs="#m-437bd9cf-4ba5-4582-a93e-e0586846e93b" label="lyrics-like">V. Bé¬</l><l xml:id="m-e42dc37b-58cf-45ae-953b-7f8916bae7b9" facs="#m-6f99e545-cfe5-4d8f-b152-df426830b24c" label="ambiguous">nedic</l><l xml:id="m-bb88fbd4-b7fb-40b0-903c-3f76e6c2cef1" facs="#m-d93baab6-90ba-4841-b388-dd6da4912e2c" label="lyrics-like">á-nima mé¬ a Dó-mi-num,</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
